{# The privacy policy's paragraph on Google reCAPTCHA, included by privacy-policy.en.html.twig when it is the captcha provider in use (see CaptchaProviderInterface) #}
<h3 data-legal-id="third-parties.recaptcha">Form protection (Google reCAPTCHA)</h3>
<div>
	Forms are protected against bots by Google reCAPTCHA. As soon as you start filling in a form, Google receives your IP address and information about your browser and browsing, to estimate whether a human sent it. This data is processed under <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>.
</div>
